{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9375a0c4e9d06f10","name":"Wroonian","source":{"id":"source:reference-9375a0c4e9d06f10","title":"Wroonian","revision":19810,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:38:49Z","sha256":"d2a6d6243489f2be6e2002ca6590ce72be80f16375cc44b08365349f0aa22c70","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19810","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Wroonian&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9375a0c4e9d06f10","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Wroonian society is based upon the desire for personal wealth and material possessions. Despite this, they are a carefree and mellow Species that enjoy taking risks and living for the moment. Wroonians distrust all types of authority, thanks in part to their planetary government's near-constant instability.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Wroonian Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," To a Wroonian, life is worth living only if you are having fun while getting rich.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Though identical to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"}," in most respects, Wroonians are set about by their blue skin and dark blue hair. A typical Wroonian stands 1.6 meters tall.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Wroonians age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-11 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["12-15 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["16-40 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["41-59 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["60-79 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["80+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The Inner Rim planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wroona"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wroona?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic and Wroonian.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Azoora, Dasha Defano, Drixar, Fillio Androu, Fume Pachoola, Iona Wince, Kabalard Vinne, Linx Mallicker, Llitishi, Nell Indigo, Pelf Pachoola, T'Charek Haathi, Tis Dolan.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," The Wroonians' dislike of authority leads them to becoming ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"},", with only a scant few becoming ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldiers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldiers"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Wroonian Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Wroonians share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Wroonians receive a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"},". Wroonians are graceful and swift, but often their physical prowess lags behind other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Wroonians have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Wroonians have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Free Spirit:"]}," Wroonians are stubborn and hard to be deterred, giving them a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Soothing Voice:"]}," A Wroonian may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Wroonians can speak, read, and write both Basic and Wroonian."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
